# Inputs of requirements.txt (the context service's image). Regenerate (the date is the age gate:
# nothing newer than it is taken):
#   uv pip compile requirements.in --generate-hashes --python-version 3.11 \
#     --python-platform x86_64-manylinux_2_28 --exclude-newer 2026-11-01T00:00:00Z \
#     --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu --extra-index-url https://pypi.org/simple \
#     --index-strategy unsafe-best-match -o requirements.txt
# then put the extra-index-url line of requirements.txt back (the compiler drops it) and set setuptools to
# 84.2.1 (one wheel hash) by hand, as modules/tts/image does: torch's metadata asks for <82, which has open
# advisories, and the install is --no-deps.
